{
 "dur": 59.886,
 "segments": [
  {
   "key": "L1",
   "type": "vo",
   "text": "Elon Musk says there will be ten billion of these.",
   "s": 0.5,
   "e": 3.021,
   "src": null
  },
  {
   "key": "L2",
   "type": "vo",
   "text": "More robots than people on Earth.",
   "s": 3.371,
   "e": 5.135,
   "src": null
  },
  {
   "key": "L3",
   "type": "vo",
   "text": "He said it in Riyadh, in twenty twenty-four: at least ten billion humanoid robots, by twenty forty.",
   "s": 5.685,
   "e": 11.225,
   "src": null
  },
  {
   "key": "L4",
   "type": "vo",
   "text": "This year, he went further.",
   "s": 11.675,
   "e": 13.227,
   "src": null
  },
  {
   "key": "MA",
   "type": "musk",
   "text": "musk 45.30 48.95",
   "s": 13.477,
   "e": 17.127,
   "src": [
    45.3,
    48.95
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "MB",
   "type": "musk",
   "text": "musk 7.05 10.95",
   "s": 17.577,
   "e": 21.477,
   "src": [
    7.05,
    10.95
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "L5",
   "type": "vo",
   "text": "So what would they actually do?",
   "s": 22.077,
   "e": 23.708,
   "src": null
  },
  {
   "key": "L6",
   "type": "vo",
   "text": "Factories first. Then warehouses. Your groceries. Your lawn.",
   "s": 24.008,
   "e": 27.538,
   "src": null
  },
  {
   "key": "L7",
   "type": "vo",
   "text": "And, in his own words, they'll babysit your kids.",
   "s": 27.838,
   "e": 30.352,
   "src": null
  },
  {
   "key": "L8",
   "type": "vo",
   "text": "One robot that could replace you? From twenty thousand dollars.",
   "s": 30.752,
   "e": 34.373,
   "src": null
  },
  {
   "key": "L9",
   "type": "vo",
   "text": "Now, the math. Tesla is aiming for a million robots a year. At that pace, ten billion would take ten thousand years.",
   "s": 34.973,
   "e": 41.259,
   "src": null
  },
  {
   "key": "L10",
   "type": "vo",
   "text": "So either the plan is wrong... or something changes.",
   "s": 41.709,
   "e": 44.6,
   "src": null
  },
  {
   "key": "MC",
   "type": "musk",
   "text": "musk 35.45 39.30",
   "s": 44.85,
   "e": 48.7,
   "src": [
    35.45,
    39.3
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "L11",
   "type": "vo",
   "text": "And the first robots for outside customers? Reportedly, late twenty twenty-seven.",
   "s": 48.85,
   "e": 53.658,
   "src": null
  },
  {
   "key": "L12",
   "type": "vo",
   "text": "Coincidence?",
   "s": 54.558,
   "e": 55.307,
   "src": null
  },
  {
   "key": "L13",
   "type": "vo",
   "text": "Every prediction leads to twenty twenty-seven.",
   "s": 55.757,
   "e": 58.286,
   "src": null
  }
 ]
}